00:41:47,624 --> 00:41:51,524
It has its own persistent identifier, a DOI, that you can

502
00:41:51,624 --> 00:41:54,164
use for referencing that, for citing that.

503
00:41:56,244 --> 00:41:58,204
So that's the core of the infrastructure.

