00:57:38,360 --> 00:57:42,200
to make sure we can have a sense for how many resources are

780
00:57:42,340 --> 00:57:44,640
used, what the user value

781
00:57:45,900 --> 00:57:46,960
provided is.

782
00:57:48,040 --> 00:57:48,260
So,

783
00:57:49,120 --> 00:57:50,180
if we had a session,

784
00:57:51,260 --> 00:57:55,220
or we could look at things for all sessions, for all

785
00:57:55,360 --> 00:57:58,900
users and so forth, we know exactly which data source has been

