01:04:41,076 --> 01:04:44,456
And, so we're literally finishing that migration this week.

903
01:04:45,336 --> 01:04:46,996
So yeah, it might not be up right now.

904
01:04:50,156 --> 01:04:54,096
So the data rescue project that we've taken on at SESR is of the

905
01:04:54,196 --> 01:04:57,996
IMLGS, which was one of those NOAA data resources that got shut

906
01:04:58,056 --> 01:04:59,676
down in early 2025.

