01:05:00,476 --> 01:05:03,936
IMLGS stands for the Index to Marine and Lacustrine Geological

908
01:05:04,056 --> 01:05:07,876
Samples. It was basically a giant search portal where people

909
01:05:07,916 --> 01:05:10,856
could find ocean and lake cores to

910
01:05:11,796 --> 01:05:15,636
reuse and subsample. These ocean and lake cores are stored in

