03:09:03,442 --> 03:09:05,202
detect and undetected.

2414
03:09:07,382 --> 03:09:11,202
You have this occurrence status, and here's the result.

2415
03:09:12,582 --> 03:09:12,782
This

2416
03:09:14,742 --> 03:09:15,522
past May,

