03:09:39,666 --> 03:09:40,626
So that's a big

2425
03:09:41,526 --> 03:09:43,166
accomplishment. And

2426
03:09:44,646 --> 03:09:47,666
a little bit about why this is happening.

2427
03:09:47,746 --> 03:09:47,926
There's

2428
03:09:49,126 --> 03:09:52,166
