and we're recommending this new language.

2430
03:09:55,885 --> 03:09:57,766
As I said, this presence and absence

2431
03:09:59,586 --> 03:10:03,286
describes the underlying biological state, whereas detected and

2432
03:10:03,346 --> 03:10:05,966
