2433
03:10:06,566 --> 03:10:09,986
The biological state is inferred from those outcomes and observation

2434
03:10:10,406 --> 03:10:13,226
process, and it's often represented as a probability.

2435
03:10:18,146 --> 03:10:18,966
Museum data,

2436
03:10:19,866 --> 03:10:23,846
or data from platforms like iNaturalist and PlantNet, are commonly called

2437
03:10:23,906 --> 03:10:27,106
