2445
03:10:54,826 --> 03:10:56,106
from the inference phase.

2446
03:10:59,706 --> 03:11:00,026
And

2447
03:11:00,846 --> 03:11:03,026
finally, here's our summary.

2448
03:11:04,066 --> 03:11:04,946
We're going to

2449
03:11:08,626 --> 03:11:09,766
say that absence

2450
03:11:12,366 --> 03:11:15,666
and related terms have been used throughout the

2451
03:11:16,086 --> 03:11:19,926
