2453
03:11:22,886 --> 03:11:26,586
two research communities, the museum community and the population biology

2454
03:11:26,646 --> 03:11:30,346
community, asking similar questions, but starting with different types of data.

2455
03:11:31,726 --> 03:11:35,646
And it's really this idea of detectability that helps us work

2456
03:11:35,686 --> 03:11:38,786
