03:26:06,986 --> 03:26:10,386
In this talk, I will be sharing with you some of the modeling work that we did as

2693
03:26:10,426 --> 03:26:14,126
part of the Australian Reference Genome Atlas project, which concluded

2694
03:26:14,266 --> 03:26:15,046
