3510
06:02:51,140 --> 06:02:53,060
And everything is interlinked and machine actionable.

3511
06:02:53,180 --> 06:02:53,380
So

3512
06:02:54,640 --> 06:02:55,740
this is what we do, and

3513
06:02:57,460 --> 06:02:58,420
going back a little bit,

3514
06:02:59,540 --> 06:03:03,400
the problem about PDFs, again, is mainly the

3515
