3518
06:03:13,320 --> 06:03:15,760
does away with a lot of this effort, thankfully.

3519
06:03:16,180 --> 06:03:17,800
Therefore, it's a way faster

3520
06:03:18,840 --> 06:03:21,840
way to move forward and a way better way to do semantics

3521
06:03:23,260 --> 06:03:23,860
in the future.

